"  bladecp partner
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Tools for BladeCP partners: catalog, customers' servers, Vibe, marketplace, webhooks and
  migrations

  Usage: bladecp partner <command> [options]

  Commands ───────────────────────────────────
  plans                   List the plans you sell, with their prices
  locations               List where each plan can run
  options                 List the configurable options and their values
  branding                Show the name, logo and favicon of your brand
  servers <command>       Create, change, suspend, cancel and open your customers' servers
