  marketplace <command>   Follow your marketplace sales, earnings, statements and base server
                          invoices
  webhooks <command>      Manage the webhooks BladeCP sends to your systems
  migrations <command>    Run Fast Deploy for your clients: WHMCS requests, billing queue and
                          account confirmation

  Details of a command: bladecp partner <command> --help"
`;

